-- Remove test seed data inserted by V5__seed_postgres_test_data.sql.
-- These records were placeholder data for development and should not exist in production.
-- Deletes are ordered to satisfy foreign key constraints.
-- Sponsorships are deleted by child_id (not just the 5 seeded IDs) to catch any
-- additional sponsorships created against seed children during local development.

